            "value": "<p><strong>Access</strong> You are an automaton or are otherwise from the ancient Jistka Imperium.</p><hr /><p>You've learned the secrets of Jistkan construct prostheses, allowing you to incorporate construct components into your dynamo and gain a portion of their magic. You gain a +1 status bonus to saving throws against magic, and your dynamo Strikes become magical.</p>"
